{"title":"Darkside","artist":"Alan Walker","date":"2026-08-01","sourceId":"14489268:001","sourceHash":"81a3e003ec58d4d8e99316202cadd14f74d6bf88365137690e6d98ec05c99a30","duration":210.2,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":13.26,"end":16.1,"text":"We're not in love","translation":"우린 사랑하는 사이가 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.44,"end":19.26,"text":"We share no stories","translation":"함께 나눈 이야기도 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.6,"end":22.92,"text":"Just something in your eyes","translation":"그저 네 눈빛 속 무언가뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":24.7,"end":26.92,"text":"Don't be afraid","translation":"두려워하지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":26.92,"end":30.38,"text":"The shadows know me","translation":"그림자들은 나를 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.38,"end":33.48,"text":"Let's leave the world behind","translation":"세상을 뒤로하고 떠나자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.48,"end":37.28,"text":"Take me through the night","translation":"밤을 지나 나를 데려가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":38.5,"end":41.55,"text":"Fall into the darkside","translation":"어둠 속으로 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":41.55,"end":44.44,"text":"We don't need the light","translation":"빛은 필요 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":44.44,"end":47.46,"text":"We'll live on the darkside","translation":"우린 어둠 속에서 살아갈 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":47.46,"end":50.4,"text":"I see it, let's feel it","translation":"보여 함께 느껴 보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":50.55,"end":52.88,"text":"While we're still young and fearless","translation":"아직 젊고 두려움이 없을 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":52.88,"end":54.75,"text":"Let go of the light","translation":"빛을 놓아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.88,"end":59.3,"text":"Fall into the darkside","translation":"어둠 속으로 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":61.88,"end":65.3,"text":"Fall into the darkside","translation":"어둠 속으로 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":67.55,"end":71.0,"text":"Give in to the darkside","translation":"어둠에 몸을 맡겨","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":75.54,"end":78.06,"text":"Let go of the light","translation":"빛을 놓아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":78.06,"end":81.62,"text":"Fall into the darkside","translation":"어둠 속으로 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":82.06,"end":83.76,"text":"Beneath the sky","translation":"하늘 아래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":83.9,"end":87.0,"text":"As black as diamonds","translation":"다이아몬드처럼 새까만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":87.36,"end":90.48,"text":"We're running out of time (time, time)","translation":"우리에게 남은 시간이 없어 시간 시간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":92.54,"end":94.82,"text":"Don't wait for truth","translation":"진실이 오길 기다리지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":94.82,"end":98.3,"text":"To come and blind us","translation":"우릴 찾아와 눈멀게 할 테니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":98.3,"end":101.98,"text":"Let's just believe their lies","translation":"그들의 거짓말을 그냥 믿자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":104.04,"end":107.0,"text":"Believe it, I see it","translation":"믿어 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":107.0,"end":109.78,"text":"I know that you can feel it","translation":"네가 느낄 수 있다는 걸 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":109.78,"end":112.54,"text":"No secrets worth keeping","translation":"지켜 둘 만한 비밀은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":112.54,"end":115.32,"text":"So fool me like I'm dreaming","translation":"그러니 꿈꾸는 것처럼 날 속여 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":115.32,"end":117.98,"text":"Take me through the night","translation":"밤을 지나 나를 데려가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":117.98,"end":120.89,"text":"Fall into the darkside","translation":"어둠 속으로 떨어져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":120.89,"end":123.34,"text":"We don't need the light","translation":"빛은 필요 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":123.34,"end":126.79,"text":"We'll live on the darkside","translation":"우린 어둠 속에서 살아갈 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":126.79,"end":129.8,"text":"I see it, let's feel it","translation":"보여 함께 느껴 보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":129.